As far as I can tell, kicking obeys significantly other rules.
How much you're carrying seems to play the biggest role---even
without being burdened, you can loose points for this.  Also,
some monsters (thick-skinned ones) aren't damaged at all by
kicking.

> And do you think I should wish for an AoR or a SDSM?  Will wearing
> armor make the game that much harder?

In the late game, not at all.  Earlier, it depends.  Get a
blessed luckstone, and raise your experience to the max.

